============================================================

### MuCastleData::Cycle ###
	Value - Castle Siege cycle length, in weeks.

### MuCastleData::ScheduleSettings::Schedule ###
	One row per siege state transition:
	State           Sequential state id (see CASTLESIEGE_STATE_*
	                in CastleSiege.h).
	Day/Hour/Minute Offset from the start of the cycle at which
	                this state begins.

### MuCastleData::NPCSettings::Npc ###
	One row per guardian/gate NPC placed for the siege:
	Monster  Monster class.
	Index    NPC slot index for this Monster class (must be
	         unique per Monster).
	DBSave   1 = this NPC's state is persisted to the DB.
	Side     0 = Defender (Guardian), 1 = Attacker/neutral (see
	         actual in-game role - the raw value is passed
	         straight to CCastleSiege's side logic).
	DFLevel  Base defense level.
	RGLevel  Base attack/rage level.
	MaxHP    Maximum HP.
	SX/SY    Spawn (source) position.
	DX/DY    Destination position, or -1/-1 if the NPC doesn't
	         move.
	Dir      Spawn direction.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

